      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>By concentrating on a visible subject and besting them in a Static Mental Challenge, you read the colors of their aura to learn their emotional state, general nature, whether they're under magical influence, have committed diablerie, or just lied; it can also reveal nearby ghosts.</p>",
