      "name": "Animalism — 1 Basic — Feral Speech",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>By meeting an animal's gaze, you can communicate with it in whines, hisses and growls. No test is needed simply to communicate, but convincing an animal to follow a command requires a Social Challenge. Most animals have the equivalent of six to eight Traits for this purpose, though some (such as trained war bees) may have as many as 12.</p>",
